sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant III as III Engine
    participant E as Express Users
    participant H as Hono Products
    participant K as Koa Inventory
    participant F as Fastify Orders

    Client->>III: POST /order/create
    III->>E: users.get(userId)
    E-->>III: user data
    III->>H: products.get(productId)
    H-->>III: product data
    III->>K: inventory.get(productId)
    K-->>III: stock count
    III->>K: inventory.update(productId, -qty)
    K-->>III: updated inventory
    III->>F: orders.create(order)
    F-->>III: order created
    III-->>Client: Complete order response
